<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    C/S =  ---			   C/S =  8.46%</p>
<p>	    O/N =  ---			   O/N =  ---</p>
<p>	    T/N =  ---			   T/N =  ---</p>
<p>		   Dec  31, 1996			Dec  30, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  6.44%	1 month forward =  6.44%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  5.93%	2 month forward =  6.94%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  6.44%	3 month forward =  7.34%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  6.70%	4 month forward =  7.28%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  6.85%	5 month forward =  7.32%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  6.86%	6 month forward =  7.18%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
